      "title": "This is the End movie review & film summary - Roger Ebert",
      "snippet": "\"This is the End\" is a very funny, suspenseful and occasionally disgusting horror-comedy from the \"Superbad\" team of Seth Rogen and Evan Goldberg. Making their directorial debut, the duo find the right mixture of humor and gruesomeness that usually evades most films of this type. With a cast of Rogen's buddies playing \"themselves,\" \"This is the End\" examines the dynamics of a group of friends ...",
